hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"249","Diyat ke bare mein, us Musalman ke qisas mein qatl kiye jane ke bare mein jis ne kisi kafir ko qatl kiya ho: [Ibn Abi Najiyah] al-Iskandarani ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, Sulayman [ibn Bilal] ne mujh se bayan kiya, Rabi'ah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Baylamani se riwayat hai; unhon ne un se bayan kiya ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas ek Musalman shakhs laya gaya jis ne ahl-e-zimmah mein se ek mu'ahid shakhs ko qatl kar diya tha, to Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us Musalman ko aage badhaya pas us ki gardan maar di gayi, aur Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Main us ke ahd ko poora karne ka sab se zyada haqdar hoon. Ibn Wahb ne kaha: Is ki tashreeh ye hai ke us ne use dhoka de kar qatl kiya tha."
"250","[Wahb ibn Bayan, Ahmad ibn Sa'id al-Hamadhani aur Ibn al-Sarh ne kaha:] Ibn Wahb ne humein khabar di, Abdullah ibn Ya'qub ne mujhe khabar di; Abdullah ibn Abd al-Aziz ibn Salih al-Hadrami ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Khaybar ke din ek Musalman ko ek kafir ke badle qatl kiya jise us ne dhoka de kar qatl kiya tha, aur farmaya: Main us ke ahd ko poora karne ka sab se zyada haqdar - ya sab se zyada mustahiq - hoon."
